{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Indeed. Nolan and I discovered some information. I know you've been spending time at <#865913981406806046>, is that correct?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:17:57.829000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867440275035389952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I was wondering if you've made any friends. It would be your way.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:18:16.077000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867440351573049364","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"More than a few, yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:19:15.240000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867440599720394752","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"Apgan regards Finn coolly. \"Nolan and I have discovered some information that may be of use to the patriots. We could use an introduction.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:21:29.374000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867441162319167529","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Also, do you have any friends in the British Army?\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:22:21.857000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867441382448037959","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Minutemen type of patriots, higher ranking soldiers, supply runners, or fellow citizens, which would be best to get you introduced with? And friends? Can't say I do that are left alive, I do have a sort of in however and 2 disguises.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:23:29.199000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867441664901120021","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"We're looking for a man by the name of Buchanan. A living shadow, born of a lamppost. Buchanan used to head the lamplighters before the attack on Friday, but we have reason to believe he is alive, and that he knew the attack was coming.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:25:11.031000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867442092015353866","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"A British spy.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:25:16.010000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867442112898662420","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"But we're looking for higher ranks. The information we have is *sensitive.* Otherwise I wouldn't be so coy.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:26:12.387000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867442349360807949","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"Hmm. I may know where he is. And where all the redcoats came into the town from. I have an infiltration planned next week\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:26:28.082000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-21T16:26:37.387000Z","id":"867442415190933504","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
