{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"860473039098740766","content":"\"I strongly suspect Buchanan may know. If we can locate and capture him, we can answer a lot of questions. About the murder of the Clutters in the Noir, about the criminal activities of the Lamplighters under Buchanan's leadership, and about the British incursion in the Noir.\"","created_at":"2021-07-21T16:29:04.708000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867443072128647208","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
